<section xmlns="http://xml.house.gov/schemas/uslm/1.0" style="-uslm-lc:I80" id="id3cb4caaf-3a72-11f1-89e5-b276cb722900" identifier="/us/usc/t22/s8131"><num value="8131">§ 8131.</num><heading> Protection of confidentiality of information</heading><content>
<p style="-uslm-lc:I11" class="indent0">Information reported to, or otherwise acquired by, the United States Government under this chapter or under the Additional Protocol shall be exempt from disclosure under <ref href="/us/usc/t5/s552">section 552 of title 5</ref>.</p>
</content><sourceCredit id="id3cb4cab0-3a72-11f1-89e5-b276cb722900">(<ref href="/us/pl/109/401/tII/s231">Pub. L. 109–401, title II, § 231</ref>, <date date="2006-12-18">Dec. 18, 2006</date>, <ref href="/us/stat/120/2747">120 Stat. 2747</ref>.)</sourceCredit>
</section>
